    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "A hostile mob. category monster puts it with the zombies: it despawns far from players and does not spawn on Peaceful. melee_attack with targets minecraft:player hunts players it can see, and retaliate makes it fight back against anything that hurts it. msm:attack sets the damage of each hit (5, two and a half hearts) and fires msm_examples:brute_hit, which plays a sound and the attack animation. The spawn rule monster spawns it only in the dark, anywhere in the overworld (#minecraft:is_overworld).",
